l by more than 20% in the first half of 2026 versus a year earlier, electric car exports increased by more than 120% 👉 https://t.co/y9MSqMWIhv https://t.co/sdFjczeI1Q","url":"https://x.com/IEA/status/2112601251091193964"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2112593770323542016"]},"author_id":"166252256","created_at":"2026-10-20T17:21:09.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112594988077027477"],"entities":{"mentions":[{"end":23,"id":"1886906824219344896","start":7,"username":"SecretaryWright"}],"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/40YzEVE4m9","end":140,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/ENERGY/status/2112594988077027477/photo/1","media_key":"3_2112593770323542016","start":117,"url":"https://t.co/40YzEVE4m9"}]},"id":"2112594988077027477","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":4349,"like_count":89,"quote_count":4,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":24},"text":"Today, @SecretaryWright announced new investments to strengthen America's power grid and lower electricity costs! 🇺🇸 https://t.co/40YzEVE4m9","url":"https://x.com/ENERGY/status/2112594988077027477"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2112585905697697792"]},"author_id":"1455964430760431622","created_at":"2026-10-20T17:03:43.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112590597798437005"],"entities":{"mentions":[{"end":144,"id":"1423520301812379648","start":130,"username":"zhou_jingtian"}],"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/tO3ow0Gni6","end":298,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/arcinstitute/status/2112590597798437005/photo/1","media_key":"3_2112585905697697792","start":275,"url":"https://t.co/tO3ow0Gni6"}]},"id":"2112590597798437005","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":38,"impression_count":5132,"like_count":79,"quote_count":3,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":11},"text":"Our cells carry the same DNA, but how this DNA is interpreted differs wildly from cell to cell. In a new preprint, Science Fellow @zhou_jingtian and team introduce Bolero, a model conditioned on cell state that predicts chromatin accessibility and expression from DNA alone. https://t.co/tO3ow0Gni6","url":"https://x.com/arcinstitute/status/2112590597798437005"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2112579779366957056"]},"author_id":"17026589","created_at":"2026-10-20T16:21:41.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112580020715569616"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/dgIB0GoHQG","end":304,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/JesseJenkins/status/2112580020715569616/photo/1","media_key":"3_2112579779366957056","start":281,"url":"https://t.co/dgIB0GoHQG"}]},"id":"2112580020715569616","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":20,"impression_count":3652,"like_count":47,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":15,"retweet_count":9},"text":"Utilities are rushing to add supply for an unprecedented wave of new large loads. Many now let large customers bring their own capacity, so new load connects sooner and existing customers are protected from rate impacts. Bring-your-own-capacity (BYOC) rules have rapidly gone from https://t.co/dgIB0GoHQG","url":"https://x.com/JesseJenkins/status/2112580020715569616"},{"author_id":"166252256","created_at":"2026-10-20T16:08:06.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112576604601712692"],"entities":{"urls":[{"description":"Anti-fossil fuel policies that raise utility bills have Democrats in the region playing defense this election year.","display_url":"wsj.com/opinion/northe…","end":259,"expanded_url":"https://www.wsj.com/opinion/northeast-energy-climate-elections-maura-healey-kathy-hochul-d96539ee","images":[{"height":640,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2112552874475495424/pv3rOsiR?format=jpg&name=orig","width":1280},{"height":150,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2112552874475495424/pv3rOsiR?format=jpg&name=150x150","width":150}],"start":236,"status":200,"title":"Opinion | The Northeast Climate Revolt","unwound_url":"https://www.wsj.com/opinion/northeast-energy-climate-elections-maura-healey-kathy-hochul-d96539ee","url":"https://t.co/7kYjGpXcIo"}]},"id":"2112576604601712692","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impre